flowchart LR
  A[Authenticated tenant request] --> B[Durable task coordinator]
  B --> C[Protocol gateway: MCP / A2A / ACP]
  C --> D[Authorized retrieval and citations]
  D --> E[Evaluation and quality gate]
  E --> F[Red-team policy gate]
  F --> G[Inference capacity and admission]
  G --> H[Multimodal evidence normalization]
  H --> I[Governance dossier and approvals]
  I --> J[Integrated release gate]
  J -->|all evidence valid| K[Release candidate accepted]
  J -->|missing, stale, unsafe or over budget| X[Fail closed / abstain / rollback]
  D -. tenant ACL .-> T[Tenant boundary]
  F -. deny untrusted action .-> X
  I -. version-bound evidence .-> J
